{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Katherine</h2>A talented witch from the magical continent that is separated from Elfland to its southwest by the ocean. Known for her elemental magic, she fights in a unique way. She has low health but strong armor. (For some mysterious reasons, her power seems to be restrained.)<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788875/extras/\u51ef\u745f\u7433_0.gif?t=1651118463\" /><br><br><strong>Infernal Lotus</strong>\uff1aShoot a mega fireball that explodes on hit. <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788875/extras/\u51ef\u745f\u7433_1.gif?t=1651118463\" /><br><br><strong>Thunder Strike</strong>\uff1aCast a thunder rune that randomly strikes an enemy every few seconds. The frequency is affected by attack speed. <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788875/extras/\u51ef\u745f\u7433_2.gif?t=1651118463\" /><br><br><strong>Glacial Tempest</strong>\uff1aCast a circling snowstorm that slows down enemies and has a chance to freeze them. <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788875/extras/\u51ef\u745f\u7433_3.gif?t=1651118463\" /><br>&quot;","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1788875?t=1651118463","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1788875?t=1651118463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788875/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1651118463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788875/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1651118463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloa